## Performance Issues

### 2. **Memory Leaks**

#### Uncleaned Event Listeners
```javascript
// Event listeners added but not always removed
btn.onclick = (e) => { /* handler */ };
btn.onmouseenter = () => { /* handler */ };
```

**Issue**: Direct property assignment doesn't get cleaned up properly.

**Fix**: Use `addEventListener` with cleanup tracking
```javascript
const cleanupHandlers = new Set();

function addCleanableListener(element, event, handler) {
  element.addEventListener(event, handler);
  cleanupHandlers.add({ element, event, handler });
}

function cleanupAllListeners() {
  cleanupHandlers.forEach(({ element, event, handler }) => {
    element.removeEventListener(event, handler);
  });
  cleanupHandlers.clear();
}
```

#### DOM Elements Not Removed
```javascript
// Selected items accumulate without cleanup
S.selectedItems.push({ overlay, item, data });
```

**Issue**: Old overlays may not be removed when elements are deleted from DOM.

**Fix**: Add mutation observer to detect removed elements
```javascript
const mutationObserver = new MutationObserver((mutations) => {
  S.selectedItems = S.selectedItems.filter(item => {
    if (!document.body.contains(item.data.el)) {
      remove(item.overlay);
      remove(item.item);
      return false;
    }
    return true;
  });
});
```

### 3. **Inefficient Operations**

#### Repeated Style Calculations
```javascript
// getComputedStyle called multiple times for same element
const cs = getComputedStyle(el);
// Later...
const cs = getComputedStyle(data.el);
```

**Fix**: Cache computed styles properly
```javascript
const styleCache = new WeakMap();

function getCachedStyle(el) {
  if (!styleCache.has(el)) {
    styleCache.set(el, getComputedStyle(el));
  }
  return styleCache.get(el);
}
```

#### Synchronous Layout Thrashing
```javascript
const r = el.getBoundingClientRect(); // Read
overlay.style.top = r.top + "px";     // Write
overlay.style.left = r.left + "px";   // Write
```

**Fix**: Batch reads and writes
```javascript
// Batch all reads first
const positions = elements.map(el => el.getBoundingClientRect());

// Then batch all writes
positions.forEach((pos, i) => {
  overlays[i].style.cssText = `top: ${pos.top}px; left: ${pos.left}px;`;
});
```

