## Feature Improvements

### 9. **Accessibility Issues**

- No keyboard navigation support
- No ARIA labels
- No screen reader support
- No focus management

**Fix**: Add accessibility features
```javascript
const button = document.createElement("button");
button.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Inspect DOM elements');
button.setAttribute('role', 'button');
button.setAttribute('tabindex', '0');

// Add keyboard support
button.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
  if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') {
    e.preventDefault();
    startInspect();
  }
});
```

### 10. **User Experience**

#### No Loading States
```javascript
iframe.src = window.location.href; // No indication of loading
```

**Fix**: Add proper loading indicators
```javascript
function loadIframe(url) {
  showLoadingIndicator();
  
  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
    iframe.onload = () => {
      hideLoadingIndicator();
      resolve();
    };
    iframe.onerror = () => {
      hideLoadingIndicator();
      showError('Failed to load page');
      reject();
    };
    iframe.src = url;
  });
}
```

#### No Undo/Redo
```javascript
// No way to undo selections or actions
```

**Fix**: Implement command pattern
```javascript
class CommandHistory {
  constructor() {
    this.history = [];
    this.current = -1;
  }
  
  execute(command) {
    command.execute();
    this.history = this.history.slice(0, this.current + 1);
    this.history.push(command);
    this.current++;
  }
  
  undo() {
    if (this.current >= 0) {
      this.history[this.current].undo();
      this.current--;
    }
  }
}
```

### 11. **Missing Features**

- **No export functionality** - Users can copy CSS but can't export all selected elements
- **No search/filter** - Can't search for specific elements
- **No comparison mode** - Can't compare multiple elements
- **No history** - Can't see previously inspected elements
- **No presets** - Can't save custom viewport presets

