## Testing Issues

### 12. **Zero Test Coverage**

There are no tests, making refactoring risky.

**Fix**: Add unit tests
```javascript
describe('DOMInspector', () => {
  let inspector;
  
  beforeEach(() => {
    inspector = new DOMInspector();
  });
  
  afterEach(() => {
    inspector.cleanup();
  });
  
  test('should start inspection on button click', () => {
    inspector.startInspect();
    expect(inspector.state.current).toBe(STATES.INSPECTING);
  });
  
  test('should highlight element on hover', () => {
    const element = document.createElement('div');
    inspector.handleMouseMove({ target: element });
    expect(inspector.overlay.isVisible()).toBe(true);
  });
});
```

